{"sha": "07ce8c272940d5d273de8d452e909fd3540626d8d058efa6f748c0d9ee9ee307", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:concentration-and-dilution} 章 --- 浓度与稀释}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:1}", "$C_m = \\qty{5.0}{g} / \\qty{0.250}{L} = \\qty{20}{g/L}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:2}", "$c = \\qty{0.050}{mol} / \\qty{0.200}{L} = \\qty{0.25}{mol/L}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:3}", "$M(\\ce{CuSO4}) = 63.5 + 32.1 + 4 \\times 16.0 = \\qty{159.6}{g/mol}$;", "$n = 0.10 \\times 0.1000 = \\qty{0.0100}{mol}$; $m = 0.0100 \\times 159.6 =", "\\qty{1.60}{g}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:4}", "$F = 1.0 / 0.050 = 20$; $V_0 = \\qty{100.0}{mL} / 20 = \\qty{5.0}{mL}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:5}", "$C_m = c \\times M = 0.10 \\times 58.5 = \\qty{5.85}{g/L}$，约", "\\qty{5.9}{g/L}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:6}", "$V_0 = c_1 V_1 / c_0 = 0.020 \\times 250.0 / 0.50 = \\qty{10.0}{mL}$", "（稀释倍数为 25）。需用 \\qty{10.0}{mL} 移液管和", "\\qty{250.0}{mL} 容量瓶。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:7}", "容量瓶只有一条标线，只为一个体积而制，", "误差远小于百分之一；烧杯的刻度", "只是粗略的参考。同样，移液管量取一个体积", "非常精确，而量筒较粗，读数", "精度较低。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:8}", "介于 \\qty{0.02}{mol/L} 与 \\qty{0.04}{mol/L} 之间：约 \\qty{0.03}{mol/L}。", "若要更精确，可在两者之间再配制标准溶液，例如在", "0.025、0.030 和 \\qty{0.035}{mol/L} 处配制，在需要处设置更细的标准色阶。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:9}", "$M(\\ce{C6H12O6}) = \\qty{180.0}{g/mol}$; $c = 50 / 180.0 =", "\\qty{0.28}{mol/L}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:10}", "$M = \\qty{342.0}{g/mol}$，故 $n = \\qty{1.00}{mol}$，$c =", "\\qty{1.00}{mol/L}$。稀释十倍后：$c = \\qty{0.100}{mol/L}$，即", "$C_m = 0.100 \\times 342.0 = \\qty{34.2}{g/L}$。一小勺", "\\qty{0.020}{L} 的溶液含蔗糖 $34.2 \\times 0.020 = \\qty{0.68}{g}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:11}", "(a) 溶质质量相同，体积为两倍：\\qty{6.0}{g/L}。", "(b) 体积约减半，溶质质量不变：约", "\\qty{24}{g/L}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 三次十倍稀释共稀释 $10^3$ 倍：", "        $\\qty{0.10}{mol/L} / 1000 = \\qty{1.0e-4}{mol/L}$.", "  \\item 若一次稀释 1000 倍，则要么需量取极少量的母液", "        （\\qty{0.1}{mL} 加入 \\qty{100}{mL} 中），难以用移液管准确量取，", "        要么需用极大的容量瓶（\\qty{1}{mL} 加入", "        \\qty{1}{L} 中）。三次十倍稀释只需普通的移液管", "        和容量瓶。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:13}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $M(\\ce{CaCl2}) = 40.1 + 2 \\times 35.5 = \\qty{111.1}{g/mol}$;", "        $n = 11.1 / 111.1 = \\qty{0.100}{mol}$; $c = 0.100 / 0.5000 =", "        \\qty{0.200}{mol/L}$.", "  \\item 每个 \\ce{CaCl2} 电离出一个 \\ce{Ca^2+} 和两个 \\ce{Cl-}：", "        $[\\ce{Ca^2+}] = \\qty{0.200}{mol/L}$，且 $[\\ce{Cl-}] =", "        \\qty{0.400}{mol/L}$.", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:14}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $r = \\qty{0.60}{cm}$, $h = \\qty{0.20}{cm}$:", "        $V = \\pi \\times 0.60^2 \\times 0.20 = \\qty{0.23}{cm^3}$，即多出", "        \\qty{0.23}{mL} 的水。", "  \\item 溶质同样溶于 \\qty{100.23}{mL} 中，而非 \\qty{100.00}{mL} 中：", "        浓度偏低 $0.23 / 100.23 \\approx", "        \\qty{0.23}{\\percent}$.", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:concentration-and-dilution:15}", "$n = 0.20 \\times 0.100 + 0.10 \\times 0.300 = 0.020 + 0.030 =", "\\qty{0.050}{mol}$，溶于 \\qty{0.400}{L} 中：$c = \\qty{0.125}{mol/L}$。这不是", "并非简单平均 \\qty{0.15}{mol/L}：稀溶液的体积是浓溶液的三倍，", "因此混合物更接近 \\qty{0.10}{mol/L}。这是", "以体积为权重的平均值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g10:concentration-and-dilution:1}", "\\textbf{1.} \\qty{0.9}{g} 溶于 \\qty{0.100}{L}：$C_m = \\qty{9.0}{g/L}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} \\qty{9.0}{g} 溶于 \\qty{1000}{mL}，即每", "毫升含 \\qty{9.0}{mg}。", ""]}